{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vjIfeYPz071793596579.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>憧憬內地有措施穩定市況，港股反覆上升。</p><p></p><p>恒指早段反覆向上，最多升過248點，上試23,500點水平，不過高位有阻力。科網股普遍造好，阿里及騰訊升約百分之3，小米更升百分之6。不過銀行股受壓，滙控跌百分之2。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T06:21:15.065877+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T05:14:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T06:58:26.303000+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T06:18:26.512790+00:00","content_hash":"4ac89abcfc280ed610e3ea0d675424c6d75986e06a546414948a3ea7e544ff13","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}